### 1. Create first phishing incident

POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents̥
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "incidentType": "PHISHING",
    "description": "Received a suspicious phishing email",
    "suspiciousUrl": "https://fakebank.test/login",
    "senderEmail": "support@example.test"
}

###

### 2. Get all incidents

GET http://localhost:8080/api/incidents̥

###

### 3. Test automatic domain extraction

POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents̥̥̥̥̥
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "incidentType": "PHISHING",
    "description": "Received another suspicious banking email",
    "suspiciousUrl": "https://fakebank.test/offer",
    "senderEmail": "alert@fakebank.test"
}

###

### 4. DNS Lookup - fakebank

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/dns?domain=fakebank.test̥

###

### 5. DNS Lookup - fakegift

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/dns?domain=fakegift.test̥

###

### 6. DNS Lookup - Unknown domain

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/dns?domain=unknown.test̥
###

### Test automatic domain and IP extraction

POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents̥
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "incidentType": "PHISHING",
    "description": "Suspicious banking website reported",
    "suspiciousUrl": "https://fakebank.test/security",
    "senderEmail": "alert@fakebank.test"
}

###

### Report another suspicious domain

POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents̥
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "incidentType": "PHISHING",
    "description": "Suspicious gift voucher website",
    "suspiciousUrl": "https://fakegift.test/reward",
    "senderEmail": "offer@fakegift.test"
}

###

### 7. Find incidents sharing the same IP

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/ip?address=192.0.2.10̥

###

### 8. Count incidents sharing the same IP

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/ip/count?address=192.0.2.10̥

###

### 9. Search an IP with no matching incidents

GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/ip?address=192.0.2.99

### 9. Search an IP with no matching incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/ip?address=192.0.2.99

###

### 10. Test DNS lookup
GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/dns?domain=fakebank.test̥
### 11. TCP communication
GET http://localhost:8080/api/network/tcp?message=Hello%20TraceRoute̥

